{
  "_comment": [
    "Answer key for the delegate-bulk-reads / bulk-reader evaluation.",
    "Ground truth is never a hardcoded line number: each positive fact carries a `locate`",
    "regex that run_tests.py resolves against the live file, so the key survives edits to",
    "the corpus. `check` mode fails loudly when a locate stops matching.",
    "Corpus is this repo itself - no fixtures to keep in sync."
  ],
  "chars_per_token": 4,
  "anchor_tolerance_lines": 3,
  "verify_window_lines": 20,
